{"name":"Dark Tavern","hex":"#634e43","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dark","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having an absolute or (more often) relative lack of light.","Extinguished."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A complete or (more often) partial absence of light.","Ignorance."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dark"},{"term":"tavern","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A restaurant or bar.","A building containing a bar licensed to sell alcoholic drinks, and offering sleeping accommodations for travelers."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tavern"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tavern","blocks":[{"text":"A tavern is a type of business where people gather to drink alcoholic beverages and be served food, such as different types of roast meats and cheese, and where travelers would receive lodging. An inn is a tavern that has a licence to put up guests as lodgers. The word derives from the Latin taberna whose original meaning was a shed, workshop, stall, or pub."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Tavern_Scene-1658-David_Teniers_II.jpg/330px-Tavern_Scene-1658-David_Teniers_II.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tavern"},{"title":"Darkness","blocks":[{"text":"Darkness is the condition resulting from a lack of illumination, or an absence of visible light."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Creation_of_Light.png/330px-Creation_of_Light.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darkness"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Jan_Steen_-_Revelry_at_an_Inn_-_WGA21761.jpg/500px-Jan_Steen_-_Revelry_at_an_Inn_-_WGA21761.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/th